# AWS Agentic Platform Engineering — Cursor agent rule

Activate when an agent task requires generating or reviewing AWS scaffolds —
Terraform modules, GitHub Actions workflows that auth to AWS, ECS/EKS/Lambda
services, Bedrock-backed gen-AI services, landing-zone scaffolds, IAM policies,
ADRs for AWS architecture decisions, golden-path docs, or any IDP work in
Catalyst.

